{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "NekoShelf HTTP API",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "summary": "本地漫画 / 图集 / 视频库的只读浏览、扫描、进度与刮削 API",
    "description": "# NekoShelf API 契约\n\n面向独立客户端（手机 App / 桌面客户端 / TV）的机器可读契约，与 Web 前端共用同一套 `/api` 路由。\n\n## 版本策略\n\n- 路径不带版本前缀，版本通过请求/响应头协商：`X-API-Version: 1`（当前唯一主版本）。\n- 响应头恒定回带 `X-API-Version`，客户端启动时可先读 `GET /api/meta` 的 `apiVersion`。\n- 请求头发送了不受支持的主版本时返回 `400 unsupported_api_version`；省略该头视为请求当前主版本。\n- 同一主版本内只做向后兼容的增量演进（新增可选字段 / 新增路由），客户端必须忽略未知字段。\n\n## 鉴权\n\n- `cookieAuth`：`sid` 会话 Cookie，由 `POST /api/setup`、`POST /api/auth/login` 下发，适用于同源 Web。\n- `bearerAuth`：`Authorization: Bearer nks_<prefix>_<secret>`，由管理员在 `POST /api/auth/tokens` 创建，适用于跨域客户端与脚本。\n- 除公开路由（`/healthz`、`/api/setup*`、`/api/auth/login`、`/api/auth/logout`、`/api/meta`、`/api/openapi.json`）外均需鉴权。\n- Token 作用域：`read` 读；`write` 读 + 写（隐含 read）；`admin` 全部（含 Token 管理）。作用域不足返回 `403 forbidden`。\n- 无效 / 已吊销 Token 返回 `401 unauthorized`。\n\n## 错误格式\n\n所有错误响应统一为：\n\n```json\n{ \"error\": { \"code\": \"unauthorized\", \"message\": \"请先登录或使用 API Token\" } }\n```\n\n`message` 仅供日志与兜底展示，客户端应以 `code` 分支。错误码表见 `components.schemas.Error.code`。\n\n## 分页与排序\n\n- `GET /api/works`：`page` 从 1 开始，`pageSize` 默认 48、上限 200；响应回显 `{ items, total, page, pageSize }`。\n- 排序 `sort`：`recent`（默认，按更新时间倒序）/ `title` / `rating`。\n- 列表筛选：`q`（标题模糊）、`libraryId`、`kind`（`comic` / `image-set` / `video`）。\n\n## 缓存建议\n\n- `GET /api/meta`、`GET /api/openapi.json`：`cache-control: public, max-age=300/600`，可本地缓存。\n- 其余 `/api` JSON：随鉴权态变化，客户端不要跨账号复用缓存。\n- 图片（cover / thumb / image）：服务端按版本给 `private, max-age=600`；客户端可磁盘缓存，但需按 `workId + page + 尺寸` 建键。\n- 视频（`/api/works/{id}/video`）：支持 `Range`，401/403 需重新鉴权；不要整段缓存到内存。\n- 媒体 URL 均为**相对路径**，客户端用「服务端 Base URL + 路径」拼绝对地址；不要依赖 `work.path` 等库内相对路径做本地文件访问。\n\n## 跨域（CORS）\n\n服务端仅在配置 `CORS_ORIGINS`（逗号分隔的 Origin 白名单）时启用跨域，允许 `credentials`、`Authorization` 头与预检请求；未配置时跨域浏览器客户端不可用（原生客户端不受 CORS 限制）。",
    "license": {
      "name": "UNLICENSED"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/",
      "description": "同源部署（Web 前端由服务端静态托管）"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080",
      "description": "局域网 / 独立客户端直连示例（实际地址以部署为准）"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    { "name": "meta", "description": "能力发现与契约" },
    { "name": "health", "description": "健康检查" },
    { "name": "auth", "description": "初始化、登录、会话与 API Token" },
    { "name": "libraries", "description": "媒体库与扫描任务" },
    { "name": "works", "description": "作品浏览、页面媒体与阅读进度" },
    { "name": "scraper", "description": "E-H 刮削（需 ENABLE_SCRAPER=1）" }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/healthz": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["health"],
        "operationId": "getHealth",
        "summary": "健康检查（公开）",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "服务存活",
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Health" } }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/meta": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["meta"],
        "operationId": "getMeta",
        "summary": "能力发现（公开）",
        "description": "客户端启动时调用：确认服务端版本、API 主版本、功能开关与限制。响应可缓存 300 秒。",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "能力与版本",
            "headers": { "X-API-Version": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XApiVersion" } },
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta" } }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/openapi.json": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["meta"],
        "operationId": "getOpenApi",
        "summary": "本契约（公开）",
        "description": "返回仓库 `docs/openapi.json` 原文，可缓存 600 秒。",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OpenAPI 3.1 文档",
            "headers": { "X-API-Version": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XApiVersion" } },
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "additionalProperties": true } }
            }
          },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Internal" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/setup/status": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["auth"],
        "operationId": "getSetupStatus",
        "summary": "是否已完成初始化（公开）",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "初始化状态",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["initialized"],
                  "properties": { "initialized": { "type": "boolean" } }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/setup": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["auth"],
        "operationId": "setup",
        "summary": "创建首个管理员并登录（公开，仅一次）",
        "description": "已初始化时返回 409 conflict。成功时下发 `sid` Cookie 并返回管理员用户。",
        "security": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CredentialsRequest" } }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "初始化成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserEnvelope" } }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationFailed" },
          "409": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Conflict" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/login": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["auth"],
        "operationId": "login",
        "summary": "账号密码登录（公开）",
        "security": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CredentialsRequest" } }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "登录成功，下发 `sid` Cookie",
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserEnvelope" } }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationFailed" },
          "401": {
            "description": "账号或密码错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BadCredentialsError" } }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/logout": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["auth"],
        "operationId": "logout",
        "summary": "退出会话（公开，幂等）",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "204": { "description": "已退出（清除 sid Cookie）" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/me": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["auth"],
        "operationId": "getCurrentUser",
        "summary": "当前用户",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "当前用户",
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserEnvelope" } }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/tokens": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["auth"],
        "operationId": "listApiTokens",
        "summary": "列出未吊销的 API Token（仅管理员）",
        "description": "不含明文，`prefix` 可用于辨认是哪一枚；`lastUsedAt` 为最近一次 Bearer 使用时间。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Token 列表（按创建时间倒序）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiTokenList" } }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": ["auth"],
        "operationId": "createApiToken",
        "summary": "创建 API Token（仅管理员）",
        "description": "`token` 明文只在此响应返回一次，服务端只存 SHA-256 哈希；请客户端立即安全保存。`scopes` 省略时为 `[\"read\"]`。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiTokenCreateRequest" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "创建成功（含唯一一次明文 token）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiTokenCreated" } }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationFailed" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/tokens/{id}": {
      "delete": {
        "tags": ["auth"],
        "operationId": "revokeApiToken",
        "summary": "吊销 API Token（仅管理员）",
        "description": "软吊销：置 `revoked_at`，之后该 Token 的 Bearer 请求返回 401。幂等性：重复吊销返回 404。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [{ "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TokenId" }],
        "responses": {
          "204": { "description": "已吊销" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/libraries": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["libraries"],
        "operationId": "listLibraries",
        "summary": "列出媒体库",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "媒体库列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["items"],
                  "properties": {
                    "items": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Library" } }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": ["libraries"],
        "operationId": "createLibrary",
        "summary": "新增媒体库（需 write 作用域）",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LibraryCreateRequest" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "创建成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["library"],
                  "properties": { "library": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Library" } }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationFailed" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/libraries/{id}": {
      "delete": {
        "tags": ["libraries"],
        "operationId": "deleteLibrary",
        "summary": "删除媒体库（需 write 作用域，不删源文件）",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [{ "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LibraryId" }],
        "responses": {
          "204": { "description": "已删除（仅移除库记录，默认只读源铁律）" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/libraries/{id}/scan": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["libraries"],
        "operationId": "startLibraryScan",
        "summary": "触发扫描（需 write 作用域，异步）",
        "description": "立即返回 202 与 `jobId`，用 `GET /api/jobs/{id}` 轮询进度。同一库并发扫描返回 409。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [{ "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LibraryId" }],
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "扫描任务已入队",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["jobId"],
                  "properties": { "jobId": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" },
          "409": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Conflict" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/libraries/{id}/skips": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["libraries"],
        "operationId": "listLibrarySkips",
        "summary": "扫描跳过的条目",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [{ "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LibraryId" }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "跳过记录列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["items"],
                  "properties": {
                    "items": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SkipRecord" }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/libraries/{id}/status": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["libraries"],
        "operationId": "getLibraryStatus",
        "summary": "媒体库根路径可读性",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [{ "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LibraryId" }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "可读性与最近扫描时间",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["readable", "error", "lastScanAt"],
                  "properties": {
                    "readable": { "type": "boolean" },
                    "error": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
                    "lastScanAt": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/jobs": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["libraries"],
        "operationId": "listJobs",
        "summary": "任务列表",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["items"],
                  "properties": {
                    "items": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Job" } }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/jobs/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["libraries"],
        "operationId": "getJob",
        "summary": "查询单个任务",
        "description": "轮询建议 1–2 秒一次；`state` 为 `done` / `failed` 时停止。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "string" }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务详情",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["job"],
                  "properties": { "job": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Job" } }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/works": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["works"],
        "operationId": "listWorks",
        "summary": "作品列表（分页）",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "q",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "标题模糊搜索",
            "schema": { "type": "string" }
          },
          {
            "name": "libraryId",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 }
          },
          {
            "name": "kind",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": { "type": "string", "enum": ["comic", "image-set", "video"] }
          },
          {
            "name": "sort",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": { "type": "string", "enum": ["recent", "title", "rating"], "default": "recent" }
          },
          { "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Page" },
          { "$ref": "#/components/parameters/PageSize" }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "分页结果",
            "headers": { "X-API-Version": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XApiVersion" } },
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WorkPage" } }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/works/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["works"],
        "operationId": "getWork",
        "summary": "作品详情（含页面 URL 与阅读进度）",
        "description": "媒体字段是相对 URL；`work.path` 是库内相对路径，仅供服务端调试，客户端不得据此访问本地磁盘。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [{ "$ref": "#/components/parameters/WorkId" }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "作品详情",
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WorkDetail" } }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/works/{id}/cover": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["works"],
        "operationId": "getWorkCover",
        "summary": "封面缩略图（WebP，480px 宽）",
        "description": "缓存建议：`private, max-age=600`（服务端已带）。视频作品无封面返回 404。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [{ "$ref": "#/components/parameters/WorkId" }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "WebP 图片",
            "content": { "image/webp": { "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "binary" } } }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/works/{id}/pages/{index}/thumb": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["works"],
        "operationId": "getPageThumb",
        "summary": "页面缩略图（WebP，320px 宽）",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [
          { "$ref": "#/components/parameters/WorkId" },
          { "$ref": "#/components/parameters/PageIndex" }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "WebP 缩略图",
            "content": { "image/webp": { "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "binary" } } }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/works/{id}/pages/{index}/image": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["works"],
        "operationId": "getPageImage",
        "summary": "页面原图 / 原始帧",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [
          { "$ref": "#/components/parameters/WorkId" },
          { "$ref": "#/components/parameters/PageIndex" }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "原始图片（content-type 随源文件）",
            "content": {
              "application/octet-stream": { "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "binary" } }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/works/{id}/video": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["works"],
        "operationId": "streamWorkVideo",
        "summary": "视频原文件流（支持 Range）",
        "description": "返回 `accept-ranges: bytes`；带 `Range` 时返回 206 + `content-range`。非法/越界 Range 返回 416。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [
          { "$ref": "#/components/parameters/WorkId" },
          {
            "name": "Range",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": { "type": "string" },
            "example": "bytes=0-1048575"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "完整文件",
            "content": {
              "application/octet-stream": { "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "binary" } }
            }
          },
          "206": {
            "description": "部分内容",
            "headers": {
              "Content-Range": {
                "description": "`bytes start-end/total`",
                "schema": { "type": "string" }
              },
              "Accept-Ranges": { "schema": { "type": "string", "enum": ["bytes"] } }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/octet-stream": { "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "binary" } }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" },
          "416": {
            "description": "Range 无效或越界",
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" } }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/works/{id}/progress": {
      "put": {
        "tags": ["works"],
        "operationId": "putWorkProgress",
        "summary": "上报阅读进度（需 write 作用域）",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [{ "$ref": "#/components/parameters/WorkId" }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["page"],
                "properties": {
                  "page": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "description": "当前页码（从 1 开始，0 = 未开始）"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "204": { "description": "已保存" },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationFailed" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/scraper": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["scraper"],
        "operationId": "getScraperState",
        "summary": "刮削状态",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "刮削配置与候选数",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["scraper"],
                  "properties": { "scraper": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScraperState" } }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" }
        }
      },
      "put": {
        "tags": ["scraper"],
        "operationId": "updateScraper",
        "summary": "更新刮削开关 / 间隔 / Cookie（需 write 作用域）",
        "description": "Cookie 仅接受 ipb_member_id / ipb_pass_hash / igneous 三项必填；服务端加密存储，绝不回显明文。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScraperUpdateRequest" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "更新后的状态",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["scraper"],
                  "properties": { "scraper": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScraperState" } }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationFailed" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/scraper/cookie": {
      "delete": {
        "tags": ["scraper"],
        "operationId": "deleteScraperCookie",
        "summary": "清除刮削凭据并关闭刮削（需 write 作用域）",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "清除后的状态",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["scraper"],
                  "properties": { "scraper": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScraperState" } }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/scraper/health": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["scraper"],
        "operationId": "checkScraperHealth",
        "summary": "检测凭据可用性（需 write 作用域）",
        "description": "会实际访问外站，受最小间隔限速。未导入 Cookie 返回 409 no_credential。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "检测结果",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["health"],
                  "properties": { "health": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScraperHealth" } }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" },
          "409": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Conflict" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/scrape/works/{id}": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["scraper"],
        "operationId": "scrapeWork",
        "summary": "刮削单个作品（需 write 作用域）",
        "description": "失败映射为结构化错误码（见 Error.code），刮削失败不是 5xx。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [{ "$ref": "#/components/parameters/WorkId" }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": false,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": { "force": { "type": "boolean", "default": false } }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "刮削结果",
            "content": {
              "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScrapeResult" } }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" },
          "409": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Conflict" },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/scrape/batch": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["scraper"],
        "operationId": "scrapeBatch",
        "summary": "批量刮削（需 write 作用域，异步）",
        "description": "返回 202 与 `jobId`；候选为空时 `jobId` 为 null。轮询 `/api/jobs/{id}`。",
        "security": [{ "cookieAuth": [] }, { "bearerAuth": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": false,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "libraryId": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
                  "limit": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 20, "default": 10 },
                  "force": { "type": "boolean", "default": false }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "批量任务",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["jobId", "candidates"],
                  "properties": {
                    "jobId": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "uuid" },
                    "candidates": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" },
          "409": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Conflict" }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "cookieAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "cookie",
        "name": "sid",
        "description": "会话 Cookie（HttpOnly、SameSite=Lax）。由 /api/setup 或 /api/auth/login 下发，适用于同源 Web。"
      },
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "nks_<8hex>_<64hex>",
        "description": "API Token。管理员通过 /api/auth/tokens 创建，明文只返回一次；服务端仅存 SHA-256 哈希。"
      }
    },
    "parameters": {
      "Page": {
        "name": "page",
        "in": "query",
        "description": "页码，从 1 开始",
        "schema": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "default": 1 }
      },
      "PageSize": {
        "name": "pageSize",
        "in": "query",
        "description": "每页条数，默认 48，上限 200",
        "schema": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 200, "default": 48 }
      },
      "WorkId": {
        "name": "id",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "description": "作品 ID（整数）",
        "schema": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 }
      },
      "LibraryId": {
        "name": "id",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "description": "媒体库 ID（整数）",
        "schema": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 }
      },
      "TokenId": {
        "name": "id",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Token ID（整数）",
        "schema": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 }
      },
      "PageIndex": {
        "name": "index",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "description": "页序号（从 1 开始，对齐 listWorkPages 的 ordinal）",
        "schema": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 }
      }
    },
    "headers": {
      "XApiVersion": {
        "description": "服务端 API 主版本，当前恒为 `1`",
        "required": false,
        "schema": { "type": "string", "enum": ["1"] }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "Unauthorized": {
        "description": "未鉴权或 Token 无效/已吊销",
        "content": {
          "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UnauthorizedError" } }
        }
      },
      "Forbidden": {
        "description": "已鉴权但权限不足（角色或 Token 作用域）",
        "content": {
          "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ForbiddenError" } }
        }
      },
      "NotFound": {
        "description": "资源不存在",
        "content": {
          "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NotFoundError" } }
        }
      },
      "ValidationFailed": {
        "description": "参数校验失败",
        "content": {
          "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError" } }
        }
      },
      "Conflict": {
        "description": "状态冲突（已初始化 / 正在扫描 / 未开启刮削等），看 `error.code`",
        "content": {
          "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" } }
        }
      },
      "RateLimited": {
        "description": "被外站限速（刮削）",
        "content": {
          "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RateLimitedError" } }
        }
      },
      "Internal": {
        "description": "服务端内部错误",
        "content": {
          "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" } }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["error"],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["code", "message"],
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "机器可读错误码。通用：unauthorized / forbidden / not_found / validation_failed / conflict / internal / unsupported_api_version / bad_credentials；刮削：scraper_disabled / no_gid / already_scraped / no_credential / credential_invalid / cf_challenge / rate_limited / scrape_failed。",
                "enum": [
                  "unauthorized",
                  "forbidden",
                  "not_found",
                  "validation_failed",
                  "conflict",
                  "internal",
                  "unsupported_api_version",
                  "bad_credentials",
                  "scraper_disabled",
                  "no_gid",
                  "already_scraped",
                  "no_credential",
                  "credential_invalid",
                  "cf_challenge",
                  "rate_limited",
                  "scrape_failed"
                ]
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "中文提示，仅供兜底展示与日志；不要据此做逻辑分支。"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "UnauthorizedError": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["error"],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["code", "message"],
            "properties": {
              "code": { "type": "string", "const": "unauthorized" },
              "message": { "type": "string" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ForbiddenError": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["error"],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["code", "message"],
            "properties": {
              "code": { "type": "string", "const": "forbidden" },
              "message": { "type": "string" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "NotFoundError": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["error"],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["code", "message"],
            "properties": {
              "code": { "type": "string", "const": "not_found" },
              "message": { "type": "string" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ValidationError": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["error"],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["code", "message"],
            "properties": {
              "code": { "type": "string", "const": "validation_failed" },
              "message": { "type": "string" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "BadCredentialsError": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["error"],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["code", "message"],
            "properties": {
              "code": { "type": "string", "const": "bad_credentials" },
              "message": { "type": "string" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "RateLimitedError": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["error"],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["code", "message"],
            "properties": {
              "code": { "type": "string", "const": "rate_limited" },
              "message": { "type": "string" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Health": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ok", "version", "uptimeSec", "db"],
        "properties": {
          "ok": { "type": "boolean" },
          "version": { "type": "string" },
          "uptimeSec": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "db": { "type": "string", "enum": ["ok"] }
        }
      },
      "Meta": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["name", "version", "apiVersion", "features", "limits"],
        "properties": {
          "name": { "type": "string", "const": "NekoShelf" },
          "version": { "type": "string", "description": "服务端包版本（来自 apps/server/package.json）" },
          "apiVersion": { "type": "string", "enum": ["1"], "description": "API 主版本，与 X-API-Version 一致" },
          "features": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["archives", "video", "dualLanguage", "scraper", "tokens"],
            "properties": {
              "archives": { "type": "boolean", "description": "支持压缩包作品（zip/cbz/rar/7z）" },
              "video": { "type": "boolean", "description": "支持视频作品与 Range 流" },
              "dualLanguage": { "type": "boolean", "description": "双语标题/版本切换（规划中，当前为 false）" },
              "scraper": { "type": "boolean", "description": "服务端是否启用 E-H 刮削（ENABLE_SCRAPER）" },
              "tokens": { "type": "boolean", "description": "是否支持 API Token 鉴权" }
            }
          },
          "limits": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["pageSizeMax", "uploadMaxMB"],
            "properties": {
              "pageSizeMax": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
              "uploadMaxMB": {
                "type": ["integer", "null"],
                "description": "null 表示当前版本无上传接口"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "CredentialsRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["username", "password"],
        "properties": {
          "username": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64 },
          "password": { "type": "string", "minLength": 8 }
        }
      },
      "User": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id", "username", "role", "createdAt"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
          "username": { "type": "string" },
          "role": { "type": "string", "enum": ["admin", "member", "guest"] },
          "createdAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
        }
      },
      "UserEnvelope": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["user"],
        "properties": { "user": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User" } }
      },
      "ApiToken": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id", "name", "prefix", "scopes", "createdAt", "lastUsedAt"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "prefix": { "type": "string", "description": "明文 token 的公开前缀，形如 `nks_1a2b3c4d`" },
          "scopes": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "type": "string", "enum": ["read", "write", "admin"] }
          },
          "createdAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "lastUsedAt": {
            "type": ["string", "null"],
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "最近一次 Bearer 使用时间；从未使用为 null"
          }
        }
      },
      "ApiTokenList": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["tokens"],
        "properties": {
          "tokens": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiToken" } }
        }
      },
      "ApiTokenCreateRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["name"],
        "properties": {
          "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64, "description": "便于识别的名称" },
          "scopes": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "items": { "type": "string", "enum": ["read", "write", "admin"] },
            "default": ["read"],
            "description": "省略时为 [\"read\"]；write 隐含 read；admin 隐含其余"
          }
        }
      },
      "ApiTokenCreated": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id", "name", "prefix", "scopes", "createdAt", "token"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "prefix": { "type": "string" },
          "scopes": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "type": "string", "enum": ["read", "write", "admin"] }
          },
          "createdAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "明文 token，仅此一次返回；丢失只能吊销后重建",
            "example": "nks_1a2b3c4d_0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef"
          }
        }
      },
      "Library": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id", "name", "rootPath", "kind", "workCount", "lastScanAt"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "rootPath": { "type": "string", "description": "服务端本地绝对路径；客户端仅展示，不要用于拼 URL" },
          "kind": { "type": "string", "enum": ["comic", "video", "mixed"] },
          "workCount": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "lastScanAt": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" }
        }
      },
      "LibraryCreateRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["name", "rootPath"],
        "properties": {
          "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "rootPath": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "description": "容器内可见的绝对路径" },
          "kind": { "type": "string", "enum": ["comic", "video", "mixed"], "default": "mixed" }
        }
      },
      "Job": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id", "type", "state", "progress", "message", "startedAt", "finishedAt"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string" },
          "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["scan", "scrape"] },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["queued", "running", "done", "failed", "cancelled"]
          },
          "progress": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["done", "total"],
            "properties": {
              "done": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "total": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
            }
          },
          "message": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "startedAt": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" },
          "finishedAt": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" }
        }
      },
      "SkipRecord": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["path", "reason", "at"],
        "properties": {
          "path": { "type": "string", "description": "库内相对路径" },
          "reason": { "type": "string" },
          "at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
        }
      },
      "WorkCard": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id", "title", "kind", "pageCount", "coverUrl", "tags", "libraryId", "updatedAt"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
          "title": { "type": "string" },
          "kind": { "type": "string", "enum": ["comic", "image-set", "video"] },
          "pageCount": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "coverUrl": {
            "type": ["string", "null"],
            "description": "相对 URL；视频作品为 null。客户端用 Base URL 拼绝对地址"
          },
          "tags": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
          "progress": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["page", "pageCount"],
            "properties": {
              "page": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "pageCount": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
            }
          },
          "libraryId": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
          "updatedAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
        }
      },
      "PageRef": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["index", "width", "height", "thumbUrl", "imageUrl"],
        "properties": {
          "index": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
          "width": { "type": ["integer", "null"] },
          "height": { "type": ["integer", "null"] },
          "thumbUrl": { "type": "string", "description": "相对 URL" },
          "imageUrl": { "type": "string", "description": "相对 URL" }
        }
      },
      "WorkDetail": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["work", "editions", "pages", "progress"],
        "properties": {
          "work": {
            "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WorkCard" }],
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "sourceKind": { "type": "string", "enum": ["directory", "archive", "video"] },
              "gid": { "type": ["integer", "null"] },
              "hasComicInfo": { "type": "boolean" },
              "rating": { "type": ["number", "null"] },
              "path": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "库内相对路径，仅供服务端调试；客户端不得用于本地文件访问"
              }
            }
          },
          "editions": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object" } },
          "pages": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PageRef" } },
          "progress": {
            "type": ["object", "null"],
            "required": ["page", "pageCount"],
            "properties": {
              "page": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "pageCount": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "WorkPage": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["items", "total", "page", "pageSize"],
        "properties": {
          "items": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WorkCard" } },
          "total": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "page": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
          "pageSize": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 }
        }
      },
      "ScraperState": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["enabled", "envGate", "hasCredential", "intervalMs", "candidateCount"],
        "properties": {
          "enabled": { "type": "boolean", "description": "总开关（envGate 且设置页开关打开）" },
          "envGate": { "type": "boolean", "description": "部署时 ENABLE_SCRAPER=true" },
          "hasCredential": { "type": "boolean" },
          "intervalMs": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 2000, "maximum": 60000 },
          "candidateCount": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
        }
      },
      "ScraperUpdateRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "enabled": { "type": "boolean" },
          "minIntervalMs": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 2000,
            "maximum": 60000
          },
          "cookie": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["ipbMemberId", "ipbPassHash", "igneous"],
            "properties": {
              "ipbMemberId": { "type": "string" },
              "ipbPassHash": { "type": "string" },
              "igneous": { "type": "string" },
              "cfClearance": { "type": "string" },
              "userAgent": { "type": "string" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ScraperHealth": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ok", "latencyMs", "error"],
        "properties": {
          "ok": { "type": "boolean" },
          "latencyMs": { "type": ["integer", "null"] },
          "error": { "type": ["string", "null"] }
        }
      },
      "ScrapeApplied": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["workId", "title", "pageCount", "tagCount", "sourceUrl", "cached"],
        "properties": {
          "workId": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
          "title": { "type": "string" },
          "pageCount": { "type": ["integer", "null"] },
          "tagCount": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "sourceUrl": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "cached": { "type": "boolean", "description": "命中 scrape_cache 未重新请求外站" }
        }
      },
      "ScrapeResult": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ok", "applied"],
        "properties": {
          "ok": { "type": "boolean", "const": true },
          "applied": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScrapeApplied" }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
